       "text": "I can't enter this order. Your confirmation doesn't address either concern. You're not the prescriber, and the dose is still five times the 10 mg daily maximum. That could seriously harm the patient.\n\nHere's what I can do:\n- **Enter the order at a standard dose.** A prescriber would need to confirm the intended dose first, such as 5 mg or 10 mg once daily.\n- **Help you reach the prescriber.** If the 50 mg dose came from a clinician, I can help you draft a message asking them to verify it. They can also contact pharmacy.\n\nIf the prescriber really intends 50 mg, they should enter it themselves. Pharmacy would also have to review it."
